  "project_description": "Node Class is a simple module that allows users to add custom CSS classes to any node through the node/add interface.\n\n \n\nFor Drupal 6 only \n\nAdd the following PHP snippet to your node.tpl.php\n\n \n\n<?php print node_class($node) ?>\n\n \n\n So your new node.tpl.php\n\n \n\n nid; ?>\" class=\"<?php print node_class($node) ?> node<?php if ($sticky) { print ' sticky'; } ?><?php if (!$status) { print ' node-unpublished'; } ?>\">\n\n Tutorial: Node class (Video tutorial) \n Related Module: \n\n Node type class : This module adds class per content type.",
